{title: 12-Bar Blues in A}
{artist: Practice progression}
{key: A}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 90}
{difficulty: intermediate}
{strumming: Shuffle: D - U D - U (long-short)}
{comment: I–IV–V with dominant sevenths. The last bar is the "turnaround" back to the top.}

{start_of_verse: 12 bars}
| A7 | A7 | A7 | A7 |
| D7 | D7 | A7 | A7 |
| E7 | D7 | A7 | E7 |
{end_of_verse}
